    family-names: Zafar
    alias: hariszafar740-lang
repository-code: "https://github.com/hariszafar740-lang/solar-pv-mppt-dynamic-solver"
abstract: >-
  Physics-based single-diode solar photovoltaic module solver (De Soto / CEC
  formulation cross-validated against NREL SAM and pvlib Lambert-W), dynamic
  MPPT control engines (P&O and Incremental Conductance), and DC-DC boost
  converter interface benchmarks.
